<description>&lt;p&gt;The government lifted the state of emergency in four regions, while ethnic violence erupted in Wau town and clashes in Lakes State left seven dead. SPLM officials in Western Equatoria dismissed reports of an attack on the chairperson-elect's residence, and gunmen opened fire on a Juba-Mundri vehicle, injuring two passengers. Women and girls continue to face severe gaps in support, with survivors of gender-based violence lacking essential services, and a rape victim walked four hours for medical care. The country is pursuing a trade and investment hub role and has partnered with Israel's Gilat to launch nationwide satellite internet. 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5UbXZaS2ROWGtoVG55Tl9RaTY3WG5CZG1ZdGJFUkVVZnZ6NGdMTzdkWE45SnJUNW1WTWZOMzBjSEJva25YQUFXYUV1dFhoNDdFdGt4UkJIRXU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE56UWt4SlA0SnpjdUhiX1J4TFFiRk1vYVN1anRLTTRnVDNRVWdrald0TVk4RXNwTE5zbGJuN1RzNEdPclpzUkM1bG1vZVdnNkdMbkV2dkp1ZXlxRHQyTHp3Z0tmVHJzb2VTSkZJdWpFYjNmQkJuYXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Stellenbosch University&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFA2TzZQMUNpLVBFbFh1RGpYNHNydFdqSmw2a3hEUUF4OHZIQnc1dmlMR21iOW4zM1ZnWDhRRXF5cTh3a0RlZDRaaklmdWRKWnVqMUQzVDNGTWtRNEdWNnJpcXFSc1R4T09yVnl4VllqY0hvZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Borgen Project&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.co